OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fvery warm evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine. Overnight some cloud may
OL,8,Fspill into the west but largely clear
OL,9,Felsewhere. A warm and uncomfortable
OL,10,Fnight to come.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA warm and sunny start, but
OL,13,Fcloud tending to increase throughout
OL,14,Fthe day making the sunshine hazy. A
OL,15,Ffew showers also possibly developing
OL,16,Fin the west. Feeling a little cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
