OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry through the weekend and into next
OL,7,Fweek, with plenty of sunshine and
OL,8,Ffeeling warm, although temperatures
OL,9,Fclosure to normal then of late.
